[
    {
        "_id": "64b58e32531092a820bb85c1",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAB.1.1",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAB",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc47999137613db26e0",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAB",
            "id": "HAB.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc47999137613db26a1"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAB.1",
        "content": "Yei ne asɛm a odiyifoɔ Habakuk nya firii Awurade nkyɛn wɔ anisoadehunu mu.",
        "reference": "Habakuk 1:1",
        "verseNumber": "1",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e32531092a820bb85f8",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAB.1.2",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAB",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc47999137613db26e0",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAB",
            "id": "HAB.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc47999137613db26a1"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAB.1",
        "content": "Ao, Awurade, memfrɛ mmisa mmoa nkɔsi da bɛn,\n    a nso wontie me?\n  Meteam mefrɛ wo, akakabensɛm enti,\n    nanso womma mmɛgye me.",
        "reference": "Habakuk 1:2",
        "verseNumber": "2",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e32531092a820bb865a",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAB.1.3",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAB",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc47999137613db26e0",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAB",
            "id": "HAB.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc47999137613db26a1"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAB.1",
        "content": "Adɛn na woma mehwɛ ntɛnkyea?\n    Adɛn enti na wotena bɔne ho?\n  Ɔsɛeɛ ne akakabensɛm da mʼanim,\n    basabasayɛ ne abɛbrɛsɛ atwa me ahyia.",
        "reference": "Habakuk 1:3",
        "verseNumber": "3",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e32531092a820bb8695",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAB.1.4",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAB",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc47999137613db26e0",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAB",
            "id": "HAB.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc47999137613db26a1"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAB.1",
        "content": "Enti, mmara nyɛ adwuma\n    na atɛntenenee nni baabiara,\n  atirimuɔdenfoɔ aka ateneneefoɔ ahyɛ,\n    enti wɔkyea atemmuo.",
        "reference": "Habakuk 1:4",
        "verseNumber": "4",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e32531092a820bb86d6",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAB.1.5",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAB",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc47999137613db26e0",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAB",
            "id": "HAB.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc47999137613db26a1"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAB.1",
        "content": "“Momma ɛnyɛ mo nwanwa,\n    na mo ho nnwiri mo!\n  Merebɛyɛ biribi wɔ mo berɛ so,\n    na sɛ obi ka kyerɛ mo a,\n    morennye nni.",
        "reference": "Habakuk 1:5",
        "verseNumber": "5",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e32531092a820bb8720",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAB.1.6",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAB",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc47999137613db26e0",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAB",
            "id": "HAB.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc47999137613db26a1"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAB.1",
        "content": "Mema Babiloniafoɔ asɔre,\n    ɔman a wɔyɛ atirimuɔdenfoɔ ne ntɔkwapɛfoɔ;\n  wɔbufa asase nyinaa so,\n    na wɔfa tenabea a ɛnyɛ wɔn dea.",
        "reference": "Habakuk 1:6",
        "verseNumber": "6",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e32531092a820bb875b",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAB.1.7",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAB",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc47999137613db26e0",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAB",
            "id": "HAB.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc47999137613db26a1"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAB.1",
        "content": "Wɔn ho yɛ hu na nnipa suro wɔn;\n    wɔyɛ wɔn bo so adeɛ,\n    de pɛ animuonyam ma wɔn ho.",
        "reference": "Habakuk 1:7",
        "verseNumber": "7",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e32531092a820bb87ec",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAB.1.8",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAB",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc47999137613db26e0",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAB",
            "id": "HAB.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc47999137613db26a1"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAB.1",
        "content": "Wɔn apɔnkɔ ho yɛ herɛ sene asebɔ,\n    na wɔn ho yɛ hu sene pataku a ɔnam anadwo,\n  wɔn apɔnkɔsotefoɔ kɔ wɔn anim mmarima so,\n    wɔfiri akyirikyiri nsase so,\n  na wɔto hoo sɛ akroma a ɔrekɔkye aboa.",
        "reference": "Habakuk 1:8",
        "verseNumber": "8",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e32531092a820bb8872",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAB.1.9",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAB",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc47999137613db26e0",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAB",
            "id": "HAB.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc47999137613db26a1"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAB.1",
        "content": "Wɔn nyinaa ba sɛ wɔrebɛyɛ basabasayɛ.\n  Wɔn dɔm pem kɔ wɔn anim te sɛ anweatam so mframa,\n    na wɔtase nneduafoɔ sɛ anwea.",
        "reference": "Habakuk 1:9",
        "verseNumber": "9",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e32531092a820bb88ac",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAB.1.10",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAB",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc47999137613db26e0",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAB",
            "id": "HAB.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc47999137613db26a1"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAB.1",
        "content": "Wɔmmmu ahene,\n    wɔdi aman sodifoɔ ho fɛw,\n  na wɔtwee nkuropɔn ho banbɔ denden.\n    Wɔsisi dɔteɛ epie nam so kyekyere atamfoɔ.",
        "reference": "Habakuk 1:10",
        "verseNumber": "10",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e32531092a820bb88d4",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAB.1.11",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAB",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc47999137613db26e0",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAB",
            "id": "HAB.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc47999137613db26a1"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAB.1",
        "content": "Wɔbɔ hoo te sɛ mframa kɔ wɔn anim.\n    Afɔdifoɔ a wɔn ahoɔden yɛ wɔn nyame.”",
        "reference": "Habakuk 1:11",
        "verseNumber": "11",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e32531092a820bb8924",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAB.1.12",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAB",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc47999137613db26e0",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAB",
            "id": "HAB.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc47999137613db26a1"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAB.1",
        "content": "Ao, Awurade, wonni hɔ firi tete anaa?\n    Me Onyankopɔn, me Kronkronni, wo a wote ase daa.\n  Ao, Awurade, woapa wɔn sɛ wɔmmu atɛn;\n    Ao Ɔbotantim, woahyɛ wɔn sɛ wɔntwe aso.",
        "reference": "Habakuk 1:12",
        "verseNumber": "12",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e32531092a820bb89d4",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAB.1.13",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAB",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc47999137613db26e0",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAB",
            "id": "HAB.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc47999137613db26a1"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAB.1",
        "content": "Wʼaniwa yɛ kronkron, a wontumi nhwɛ nnebɔne;\n    wonnyegye bɔne so.\n  Na ɛdeɛn enti na wogyegye nnipa kɔntɔnkye so,\n    na ɛdeɛn enti na wayɛ komm wɔ ɛberɛ a\n    atirimuɔdenfoɔ remene ateneneefoɔ?",
        "reference": "Habakuk 1:13",
        "verseNumber": "13",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e33531092a820bb8a45",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAB.1.14",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAB",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc47999137613db26e0",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAB",
            "id": "HAB.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc47999137613db26a1"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAB.1",
        "content": "Woama nnipa ayɛ sɛ nsuomnam a ɛwɔ ɛpo mu,\n    te sɛ abɔdeɛ a ɛwɔ ɛpo mu a wonni sodifoɔ.",
        "reference": "Habakuk 1:14",
        "verseNumber": "14",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e33531092a820bb8a99",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAB.1.15",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAB",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc47999137613db26e0",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAB",
            "id": "HAB.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc47999137613db26a1"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAB.1",
        "content": "Ɔtamfoɔ tirimuɔdenfoɔ no de darewa yi wɔn,\n    ɔgu nʼasau de buma wɔn,\n    na afei ɔsɛpɛ ne ho ma nʼani gye.",
        "reference": "Habakuk 1:15",
        "verseNumber": "15",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e33531092a820bb8b03",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAB.1.16",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAB",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc47999137613db26e0",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAB",
            "id": "HAB.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc47999137613db26a1"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAB.1",
        "content": "Ne saa enti ɔbɔ afɔdeɛ ma nʼasau\n    na wahye aduhwam ama no,\n  ɛfiri sɛ asau yi so na ɔnam nya ateyie,\n    na ɔdi nʼakɔnnɔ aduane.",
        "reference": "Habakuk 1:16",
        "verseNumber": "16",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e33531092a820bb8b5e",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAB.1.17",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAB",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc47999137613db26e0",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAB",
            "id": "HAB.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc47999137613db26a1"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAB.1",
        "content": "Enti ɔnkɔ so nni nʼasau mu nam,\n    na ɔmfa atirimuɔden nsɛe aman anaa?",
        "reference": "Habakuk 1:17",
        "verseNumber": "17",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e33531092a820bb8cb7",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAB.2.1",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAB",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc47999137613db26f2",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAB",
            "id": "HAB.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc47999137613db26a1"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAB.2",
        "content": "Mɛgyina mʼahwɛeɛ na mawɛn.\n    Mɛbɔ nsra\n  na mahwɛ deɛ ɔbɛka akyerɛ me,\n    ne mʼanoyie a mede bɛma nkurobɔ yi.",
        "reference": "Habakuk 2:1",
        "verseNumber": "1",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e33531092a820bb8ce0",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAB.2.2",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAB",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc47999137613db26f2",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAB",
            "id": "HAB.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc47999137613db26a1"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAB.2",
        "content": "Afei, Awurade buaa sɛ,\n  “Twerɛ adiyie yi wɔ abopono so\n    ma emu nna hɔ pefee\n  ama ɔkenkanfoɔ ate aseɛ.",
        "reference": "Habakuk 2:2",
        "verseNumber": "2",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e33531092a820bb8d13",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAB.2.3",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAB",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc47999137613db26f2",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAB",
            "id": "HAB.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc47999137613db26a1"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAB.2",
        "content": "Adiyisɛm no retwɛn hyɛberɛ bi;\n    ɛka awieeɛ ho asɛm\n  na ɛbɛba mu.\n    Ɛwom sɛ ɛrekyɛre deɛ, nanso twɛn,\n    ɛrenkyɛre, ɛbɛba mu.",
        "reference": "Habakuk 2:3",
        "verseNumber": "3",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e33531092a820bb8d46",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAB.2.4",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAB",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc47999137613db26f2",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAB",
            "id": "HAB.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc47999137613db26a1"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAB.2",
        "content": "“Hwɛ, wama ne ho so;\n    nʼapɛdeɛ ntene,\n    nanso ɔteneneeni firi gyidie mu bɛnya nkwa.",
        "reference": "Habakuk 2:4",
        "verseNumber": "4",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e34531092a820bb8d8a",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAB.2.5",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAB",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc47999137613db26f2",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAB",
            "id": "HAB.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc47999137613db26a1"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAB.2",
        "content": "Nokorɛm, nsã ayi no ama\n    wayɛ ahantan na ɔnni ahotɔ.\n  Esiane sɛ ɔyɛ adifudepɛ sɛ damena\n    na ɔte sɛ owuo a hwee mmee no enti\n  ɔfom aman no nyinaa\n    na ɔfa amanfoɔ no nyinaa nnommum.",
        "reference": "Habakuk 2:5",
        "verseNumber": "5",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e34531092a820bb8dc7",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAB.2.6",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAB",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc47999137613db26f2",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAB",
            "id": "HAB.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc47999137613db26a1"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAB.2",
        "content": "“Nnommumfoɔ yi nyinaa bɛdi ne ho fɛ asere no aka sɛ,\n  “ ‘Nnome nka deɛ ɔboaboa korɔnodeɛ ano,\n    na ɔnam apoobɔ so nya ne ho!\n    Yei nkɔ so nkɔsi da bɛn?’",
        "reference": "Habakuk 2:6",
        "verseNumber": "6",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e34531092a820bb8e1a",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAB.2.7",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAB",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc47999137613db26f2",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAB",
            "id": "HAB.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc47999137613db26a1"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAB.2",
        "content": "Wɔn a wode wɔn ka no bɛsɔre mpofirim so.\n    Wɔbɛsɔre ama wo ho apopo\n    na wɔbɛtwi afa wo so.",
        "reference": "Habakuk 2:7",
        "verseNumber": "7",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e34531092a820bb8e68",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAB.2.8",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAB",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc47999137613db26f2",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAB",
            "id": "HAB.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc47999137613db26a1"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAB.2",
        "content": "Esiane sɛ woafo aman bebree enti,\n    wɔn a wɔaka no bɛfo wo bi.\n  Ɛfiri sɛ woahwie nnipa mogya agu;\n    woasɛe nsase, nkuropɔn ne wɔn a wɔtete mu.",
        "reference": "Habakuk 2:8",
        "verseNumber": "8",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e34531092a820bb8eb5",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAB.2.9",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAB",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc47999137613db26f2",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAB",
            "id": "HAB.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc47999137613db26a1"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAB.2",
        "content": "“Nnome nka deɛ ɔde korɔnodeɛ kyekyere ne ɔman,\n    a ɔyɛ ne pirebuo wɔ sorɔnsorɔmmea,\n    sɛdeɛ ɔbɛyi ne ho afiri ɔsɛeɛ mu.",
        "reference": "Habakuk 2:9",
        "verseNumber": "9",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e34531092a820bb8ec3",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAB.2.10",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAB",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc47999137613db26f2",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAB",
            "id": "HAB.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc47999137613db26a1"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAB.2",
        "content": "Woatu nnipa bebree sɛeɛ ho agyina,\n    de agu wo fie anim ase, na wode wo nkwa atwa so.",
        "reference": "Habakuk 2:10",
        "verseNumber": "10",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e34531092a820bb8f06",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAB.2.11",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAB",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc47999137613db26f2",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAB",
            "id": "HAB.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc47999137613db26a1"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAB.2",
        "content": "Aboɔ a ɛhyehyɛ afie afasuo mu no bɛteam\n    na ɛbɛgyegye wɔ mpunan a wɔahyehyɛ no mu.",
        "reference": "Habakuk 2:11",
        "verseNumber": "11",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e34531092a820bb8f41",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAB.2.12",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAB",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc47999137613db26f2",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAB",
            "id": "HAB.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc47999137613db26a1"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAB.2",
        "content": "“Nnome nka deɛ ɔnam mogya hwieguo so kyekyere kuropɔn\n    na ɔnam awudie so kyekyere kuro.",
        "reference": "Habakuk 2:12",
        "verseNumber": "12",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e34531092a820bb8f8d",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAB.2.13",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAB",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc47999137613db26f2",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAB",
            "id": "HAB.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc47999137613db26a1"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAB.2",
        "content": "Asafo Awurade ahyɛ sɛ,\n    nnipa no adwumayɛ bɛyɛ ogya a wɔhye.\n  Aman no brɛ gu kwa.",
        "reference": "Habakuk 2:13",
        "verseNumber": "13",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e34531092a820bb8fe9",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAB.2.14",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAB",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc47999137613db26f2",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAB",
            "id": "HAB.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc47999137613db26a1"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAB.2",
        "content": "Na Awurade animuonyam ho nimdeɛ bɛhyɛ asase nyinaa ma,\n    sɛdeɛ nsuo hyɛ ɛpo ma no.",
        "reference": "Habakuk 2:14",
        "verseNumber": "14",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e34531092a820bb902a",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAB.2.15",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAB",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc47999137613db26f2",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAB",
            "id": "HAB.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc47999137613db26a1"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAB.2",
        "content": "“Due! Wo a woma wo mfɛfoɔ nsã,\n    Wohwie ma wɔnom kɔsi sɛ wɔbɛboro,\n    na afei woahwɛ wɔn adagya.",
        "reference": "Habakuk 2:15",
        "verseNumber": "15",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e34531092a820bb9084",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAB.2.16",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAB",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc47999137613db26f2",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAB",
            "id": "HAB.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc47999137613db26a1"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAB.2",
        "content": "Worennya animuonyam biara. Wʼani bɛwu.\n    Afei aduru wo so. Nom na tɔ ntintan.\n  Kuruwa a ɛfiri Awurade nsa nifa reba wo so,\n    Aniwuo bɛkata wʼanimuonyam so",
        "reference": "Habakuk 2:16",
        "verseNumber": "16",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e34531092a820bb90cc",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAB.2.17",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAB",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc47999137613db26f2",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAB",
            "id": "HAB.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc47999137613db26a1"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAB.2",
        "content": "Awurukasɛm a wode adi Lebanon no bɛmene wo,\n    ɔsɛeɛ a wosɛee mmoa nso bɛbɔ wo hu.\n  Woaka nnipa mogya agu;\n    woasɛe nsase, nkuropɔn ne nnipa a wɔwɔ mu.",
        "reference": "Habakuk 2:17",
        "verseNumber": "17",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e34531092a820bb90d9",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAB.2.18",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAB",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc47999137613db26f2",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAB",
            "id": "HAB.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc47999137613db26a1"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAB.2",
        "content": "“Ɛdeɛn mfasodeɛ na monya firi ahoni a onipa ayɛ mu?\n    Anaa nsɛsodeɛ a ɛkyerɛkyerɛ atorɔ?\n  Deɛ ɔyɛ ohoni no de ne ho to ɔno ankasa nsa ano adwuma so;\n    na ɔyɛ anyame a wɔntumi nkasa.",
        "reference": "Habakuk 2:18",
        "verseNumber": "18",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e34531092a820bb9115",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAB.2.19",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAB",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc47999137613db26f2",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAB",
            "id": "HAB.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc47999137613db26a1"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAB.2",
        "content": "Nnome nka deɛ ɔka kyerɛ dua sɛ, ‘Nya nkwa!’\n    Anaa ɔka kyerɛ ɛboɔ a ɛnni nkwa sɛ, ‘Nyane!’\n  Ɛbɛtumi ama akwankyerɛ?\n    Wɔde sika kɔkɔɔ ne dwetɛ adura ho;\n    nanso ahomeɛ nni mu.”",
        "reference": "Habakuk 2:19",
        "verseNumber": "19",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e35531092a820bb915c",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAB.2.20",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAB",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc47999137613db26f2",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAB",
            "id": "HAB.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc47999137613db26a1"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAB.2",
        "content": "Nanso Awurade wɔ nʼasɔrefie kronkron mu.\n    Momma asase nyinaa nyɛ komm wɔ nʼanim.",
        "reference": "Habakuk 2:20",
        "verseNumber": "20",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e35531092a820bb921e",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAB.3.1",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAB",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc47999137613db2770",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAB",
            "id": "HAB.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc47999137613db26a1"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAB.3",
        "content": "Saa mpaeɛbɔ yi, Habakuk too no sɛ dwom:",
        "reference": "Habakuk 3:1",
        "verseNumber": "1",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e35531092a820bb924a",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAB.3.2",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAB",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc47999137613db2770",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAB",
            "id": "HAB.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc47999137613db26a1"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAB.3",
        "content": "Awurade, mate wo ho nsɛm nyinaa,\n    na me ho adwiri me wɔ wʼanwanwannwuma a woayɛ ho,\n  Yɛ no foforɔ wɔ yɛn mmerɛ so.\n    Yɛn mmerɛ yi mu, ma wɔnhunu.\n    Wʼabofuhyeɛ mu no, kae wo mmɔborɔhunu.",
        "reference": "Habakuk 3:2",
        "verseNumber": "2",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e35531092a820bb9284",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAB.3.3",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAB",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc47999137613db2770",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAB",
            "id": "HAB.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc47999137613db26a1"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAB.3",
        "content": "Onyankopɔn firi Teman baeɛ,\n    Ɔkronkronni a ɔfiri Bepɔ Paran so,\n  Nʼanimuonyam kata ɔsoro,\n    na nʼayɛyie hyɛ asase so ma.",
        "reference": "Habakuk 3:3",
        "verseNumber": "3",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e35531092a820bb92a0",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAB.3.4",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAB",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc47999137613db2770",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAB",
            "id": "HAB.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc47999137613db26a1"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAB.3",
        "content": "Ɔhyerɛn sɛ anɔpawia.\n    Ɛhan no twa ogya firi ne nsam,\n    Ɛhɔ na ne tumi ahinta.",
        "reference": "Habakuk 3:4",
        "verseNumber": "4",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e35531092a820bb9302",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAB.3.5",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAB",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc47999137613db2770",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAB",
            "id": "HAB.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc47999137613db26a1"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAB.3",
        "content": "Ɔyaredɔm di nʼanim kɔ;\n    Na nsaneyadeɛ di nʼakyi pɛɛ.",
        "reference": "Habakuk 3:5",
        "verseNumber": "5",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e35531092a820bb9348",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAB.3.6",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAB",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc47999137613db2770",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAB",
            "id": "HAB.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc47999137613db26a1"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAB.3",
        "content": "Sɛ ɔgyina a, asase woso.\n    Sɛ ɔhwɛ a, ɔma aman woso.\n  Tete mmepɔ dwiri,\n    na nkokoɔ a ɛfiri tete no ka sram so.\n    Nʼakwan nntwa mu da.",
        "reference": "Habakuk 3:6",
        "verseNumber": "6",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e35531092a820bb93aa",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAB.3.7",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAB",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc47999137613db2770",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAB",
            "id": "HAB.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc47999137613db26a1"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAB.3",
        "content": "Mehunuu Kusanfoɔ ntomadan a ateteɛ\n    ne Midianfoɔ atenaeɛ a agyigya.",
        "reference": "Habakuk 3:7",
        "verseNumber": "7",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e35531092a820bb93d3",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAB.3.8",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAB",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc47999137613db2770",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAB",
            "id": "HAB.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc47999137613db26a1"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAB.3",
        "content": "Awurade, wo bo fuu nsubɔntene no?\n    Wʼabofuo no tiaa nsuwansuwa no?\n  Wosɔre tiaa ɛpo,\n    ɛberɛ a wo ne wʼapɔnkɔ\n    ne nkonimdie nteaseɛnam nam.",
        "reference": "Habakuk 3:8",
        "verseNumber": "8",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e35531092a820bb9415",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAB.3.9",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAB",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc47999137613db2770",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAB",
            "id": "HAB.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc47999137613db26a1"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAB.3",
        "content": "Woyii wo tadua,\n    Wobisaa sɛ wɔmmrɛ wo agyan bebree.\n    Wode nsubɔntene paapae asase mu.",
        "reference": "Habakuk 3:9",
        "verseNumber": "9",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e35531092a820bb9442",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAB.3.10",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAB",
        "chapter": {
