            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc47999137613db26a1"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAB.3",
        "content": "Mmepɔ hunuu wo, na wɔwosoeɛ\n    Nsuohwiam bɛsene kɔeɛ.\n  Ebunu no woro so,\n    na ɛhuru baa soro.",
        "reference": "Habakuk 3:10",
        "verseNumber": "10",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e36531092a820bb94a4",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAB.3.11",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAB",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc47999137613db2770",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAB",
            "id": "HAB.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc47999137613db26a1"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAB.3",
        "content": "Owia ne ɔsrane gyinagyinaa sorosoro hɔ,\n    ɛberɛ a wohunuu wʼagyan a ɛnenam ewiem no hann no\n    ne wo pea a ɛpa nyinam nyinam no.",
        "reference": "Habakuk 3:11",
        "verseNumber": "11",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e36531092a820bb9517",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAB.3.12",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAB",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc47999137613db2770",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAB",
            "id": "HAB.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc47999137613db26a1"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAB.3",
        "content": "Wʼabufuhyeɛ mu no, wonante twaa asase so\n    na wode abufuo tiatiaa aman no so.",
        "reference": "Habakuk 3:12",
        "verseNumber": "12",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e36531092a820bb9557",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAB.3.13",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAB",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc47999137613db2770",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAB",
            "id": "HAB.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc47999137613db26a1"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAB.3",
        "content": "Wobaeɛ sɛ worebɛgye wo nkurɔfoɔ,\n    na woagye deɛ wɔasra no no nkwa.\n  Wopɛkyɛɛ atirimuɔdenfoɔ ɔman no kandifoɔ,\n    wopaa ne ho ntoma firi ne tiri so kɔsii ne nan ase.",
        "reference": "Habakuk 3:13",
        "verseNumber": "13",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e36531092a820bb95a2",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAB.3.14",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAB",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc47999137613db2770",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAB",
            "id": "HAB.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc47999137613db26a1"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAB.3",
        "content": "Wode ɔno ankasa pea hweree ne tiri mu,\n    ɛberɛ a nʼakofoɔ bɔɔ yerɛdɛ sɛ wɔrebɛhwete yɛn mu.\n  Wɔpɛɛ sɛ wɔbɛtɔre\n    mmɔborɔfoɔ a wɔakɔ atɛ no ase koraa.",
        "reference": "Habakuk 3:14",
        "verseNumber": "14",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e36531092a820bb95d9",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAB.3.15",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAB",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc47999137613db2770",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAB",
            "id": "HAB.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc47999137613db26a1"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAB.3",
        "content": "Wode wʼapɔnkɔ tiatiaa ɛpo no mu,\n    ma nsuo kɛseɛ no huruiɛ.",
        "reference": "Habakuk 3:15",
        "verseNumber": "15",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e36531092a820bb95e5",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAB.3.16",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAB",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc47999137613db2770",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAB",
            "id": "HAB.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc47999137613db26a1"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAB.3",
        "content": "Meteeɛ no, mʼakoma tuuɛ,\n    nnyegyeeɛ no maa mʼano poo biribiri;\n  aporɔ hyɛnee me nnompe mu,\n    na me nan wosoeɛ.\n  Nanso mɛto me bo ase atwɛn akɔsi sɛ\n    amanehunu da bɛduru ɔman a wɔto hyɛɛ yɛn so no.",
        "reference": "Habakuk 3:16",
        "verseNumber": "16",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e36531092a820bb961c",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAB.3.17",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAB",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc47999137613db2770",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAB",
            "id": "HAB.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc47999137613db26a1"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAB.3",
        "content": "Ɛwom, borɔdɔma nnua no nguu nhwiren,\n    na aba nso nni bobe no so;\n  ɛwom, ngo dua no adi hwammɔ\n    na mfuo no mmɔ aduane.\n  Ɛwom, nnwan biara nni buo no mu,\n    na anantwie nso nni ban no mu.",
        "reference": "Habakuk 3:17",
        "verseNumber": "17",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e36531092a820bb9676",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAB.3.18",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAB",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc47999137613db2770",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAB",
            "id": "HAB.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc47999137613db26a1"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAB.3",
        "content": "Nanso, mʼani bɛgye Awurade mu;\n    me ho bɛsɛpɛ me wɔ Onyankopɔn a\n    ɔyɛ mʼagyenkwa no mu.",
        "reference": "Habakuk 3:18",
        "verseNumber": "18",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e36531092a820bb96c1",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAB.3.19",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAB",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc47999137613db2770",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAB",
            "id": "HAB.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc47999137613db26a1"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAB.3",
        "content": "Otumfoɔ Awurade yɛ mʼahoɔden.\n    Ɔma me nan yɛ sɛ ɔforoteɛ deɛ,\n    ɔma me nante sorɔnsorɔmmea.\n  Wɔmfa mpaeɛ yi mma nnwomtofoɔ ntuanoni no. Na wɔnto no wɔ me nhoma nnwontodeɛ no so.",
        "reference": "Habakuk 3:19",
        "verseNumber": "19",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    }
]